            0.151,
            0.341,
            0.562,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Estimating Sums and Differences"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.373,
            0.848,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sonu has observed sums and differences of decimal numbers and says, “If we add two decimal numbers, then the sum will always be greater than the sum of their whole number parts. Also, the sum will always be less than 2 more than the sum of their whole number parts.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.447,
            0.771,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us use an example to understand what his claim means:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.465,
            0.848,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If the two numbers to be added are 25.936 and 8.202, the claim is that their sum will be greater than 25 + 8 (whole number parts) and will be less than 25 + 1 + 8 + 1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.53,
            0.802,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? What do you think about this claim? Verify if this is true for these numbers. Will it work for any 2 decimal numbers?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.522,
            0.905,
            0.575
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 12,
